  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.41 - AM021 implicit element conversion modelling\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM021 now uses Roslyn conversion classification after existing analyzer-specific element checks\n            - Compiler-known implicit element conversions, including value-object collection elements, are treated as safe\n            - Explicit-only element conversions still report and require explicit mapping configuration\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (837 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #116 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.40 - AM001 implicit conversion modelling",
